id: dematerialize
name: Dematerialize
advancement: true
prerequisite: Scholarship or Magic Score 7+
tpCost: 6
dematerialize: true
source: Core Rule
text: >
  Dematerialize: Just as you can create, so too can you destroy.
  –Prerequisites: Scholarship or Magic Score 7+
  –TP Cost: 6
  –Effect: You may forgo Magical Materialization’s effect to target an item created through Magical
  Materialization within your Melee Range and destroy it.

---

# Offered when it is used: one Item marked Materialized - the user's own, or the targeted Character's -
# destroyed, and nothing made.
